Package: vajra
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Vajra Project Team <team@vajra.org>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2)
Description: Offline-First Digital Forensics & Secure Data Sanitization Platform
 Vajra provides end-to-end digital evidence recovery with an itemized
 composite confidence score, paired with multi-layer-verified data sanitization
 and tamper-evident audit logging.
